Suggests: wl-clipboard | xclip | xsel
Description: terminal text editor with menus, tables and encryption
 isi is a text editor for the terminal with drop-down menus that work
 with the mouse or the Tab key, line numbers, tables that realign
 themselves while you type, CSV import and
 file encryption with XChaCha20-Poly1305 and Argon2id.
 .
 It can highlight indicators of compromise (domains, IP addresses,
 URLs, executables and hashes) and defang or refang them, which is
 useful when handling malware reports.
 .
 The interface is available in 23 languages and follows the system
 language, with Spanish as the default.
